        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: స్వరం",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "స్వరం — svaraṁ — \"a musical note; a voice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆమె స్వరం చాలా మధురంగా ఉంటుంది. āme svaraṁ cālā madhuraṅgā uṇṭundi. Her voice is very sweet."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: స్వరాలు, svarālu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural స్వరాలు: the seven notes of Indian music."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "స్వరం (svaraṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit svara, \"sound; a musical note\" (CDIAL 13908)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
