              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "గాత్రం — gātraṁ — \"a singing voice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆమె గాత్రం విని అందరూ ఆశ్చర్యపోయారు. āme gātraṁ vini andarū āścaryapōyāru. Everyone was amazed to hear her singing voice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In music, singing as against instruments."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "గాత్రం (gātraṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit gātra, \"a limb; the body\" (CDIAL 4124); in Telugu music it is the voice, the body's own instrument."
            }
          ]
        },
